        IF NOT `the Review Board makes an order for an assessment of the accused under section 672.121` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): "If the Review Board makes an order for an assessment of an accused under section 672.121"
        IF `the accused is currently subject to a disposition made under paragraph 672.54(c)` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the accused shall not be detained in custody under the order unless"
        IF `the Review Board is satisfied on the evidence that custody is necessary to assess the accused` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the accused shall not be detained in custody under the order unless"
        IF `on the evidence of a medical practitioner custody is desirable to assess the accused` AND `the accused consents to custody` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the accused shall not be detained in custody under the order unless"
        IF `custody of the accused is required in respect of any other matter or by virtue of any other provision of this Act` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the accused shall not be detained in custody under the order unless"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- 672.16(1.2): subject to paragraphs (1.1)(b) and (c), if the accused is subject to a disposition under paragraph 672.54(b) that requires the accused to reside at a specified place, an assessment ordered under 672.121 shall require the accused to reside at the same place.
